# Watch only, never built: the live store runs upstream's own victoria-logs image (v1.54.0 ships Go 1.27.4 and
# klauspost/compress v1.20.4 and passes the scan gate). The weekly upstream-watch fails when upstream
# releases a newer stable version, the cue to check its image's CVE scan and re-pin the store.
# Bump UPSTREAM_TAG when the store is re-pinned.
UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaLogs
UPSTREAM_TAG=v1.54.0
